// Core's sources unmodified, whose results agree. Regenerate with:
//   gen.py corpus --probe <v24 probe> --probe <v23 probe> \
//     --header <this comment> --out pkgs/pkc/corpus/bls_wrapper.json5
//
// eager: L and B give the outcome under the legacy and basic flags. T is
